0,south,"I will start by exploring the level to gather more information about the layout and potential locations of the stairs down. Given the horizontal wall near the north, northeast, and northwest, I will initially move south to avoid hitting a wall. As I move, I will use the 'search' action periodically to look for hidden doors and passages. If I encounter a door, I will use the 'open' action to pass through it. If I encounter an enemy, I will use the 'kick' action to defend myself. My primary goal is to reach the stairs down, so I will prioritize exploration and information gathering over combat and treasure collection. I will also keep track of my health and use potions as needed to heal.","message:


